# Local AI/agent tooling — instructions, skill definitions, and scratch
# workspaces for whatever assistant a given contributor happens to use.
# Deliberately not shipped: it's personal tooling config, not part of the
# project, and nobody cloning this should have to pull (or wonder about)
# someone else's agent setup. Project documentation that agents merely
# *read* — README/ARCHITECTURE/CONTEXT.md and docs/adr/ — stays tracked,
# because that's genuinely for humans too.
.claude/
.agents/
.scratch/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
docs/agents/
.cursor/
.cursorrules
.aider*
.windsurfrules
.github/copilot-instructions.md
